  "changelog": "- Profile rules can test what is selected: the file types (`png`, `pdf`…) and kinds (image, video, audio, PDF, archive, text, folder) of the selected files are signals. The dial reads them as it opens; a phone's deck follows them while it is connected. They have no value outside a file manager, or for a selection with a type this plugin doesn't list.",
